t(30, 200, """As for the experienced one enlightened by the light of Allah Almighty, he is the ship of salvation .. few have boarded it .. and the numbers of those who shun it have grown great .. People do not love the light because it shines in their consciences .. it cuts them as a knife cuts, and they see the truth of themselves exposed to them and feel the scale of the shame .. so they persist and walk behind their master Iblis .. they follow him at the end of the road .. a sorry end""")

