t(32, 820, """In its simplest form .. in our modern age, nations either cooperate or clash .. there are no middle solutions .. every cooperation leads to cooperation, and every clash in the end leads to cooperation!

In the 21st century things are not like 1000 or 3000 years ago, unless a whole nation decides to eat from what it grows, wear and build from what it makes, and buy nothing at all from the rest of the nations, however important and influential that thing is in its people's lives, such as medicine, weapons, technology of all kinds and types, and hundreds of things without which human life no longer runs properly.

If any nation decides not to close itself off, two paths lie before it .. either an international policy with negligence, defeatism, submission and humiliation .. or an international policy that preserves its dignity and independence, and the second option is coming for our Ummah in its future, Allah Almighty willing.""")

